<Base title="The Mindset Revolution" description="Explore the beliefs and experiences that shape how you lead and live. Ask about The Mindset Revolution with Loren Michaels Harris."><section class="program-opening"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">A PROGRAM WITH LOREN MICHAELS HARRIS</p><h1>The Mindset<br/><span class="gold-text">Revolution.</span></h1><p class="program-lead">Look at the story you’ve been living.<br/>Decide what you want to carry forward.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/?service=program" id="application">Ask about the program ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="#experience">Explore the focus ↓</a></div><div class="program-circle" aria-hidden="true"><span>LOOK AGAIN.</span></div></div></section><section class="section wrap" id="experience"><p class="eyebrow">SPACE TO EXAMINE. ROOM TO GROW.</p><h2>Begin with what<br/>you want to understand.</h2><div class="topic-columns"><article><h3>The beliefs you carry</h3><p>Explore the assumptions and experiences that influence how you see yourself and respond to a challenge.</p></article><article><h3>The story you tell</h3><p>Consider how you describe your experience, and what a different perspective might reveal.</p></article><article><h3>The steps you choose</h3><p>Bring your questions about a leadership challenge, a personal transition, or a decision you’re facing.</p></article></div></section><section class="section story-section"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU COMMIT</p><h2>Make sure the<br/>program fits you.</h2></div><div><p>Use the program inquiry to discuss learning format, private-session support, schedule, access, and current enrollment details.</p><p>For focused work on a speech or your delivery, <a href="/services/coaching/">explore coaching</a>.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/?service=program">Start a program conversation ↗</a></div></div></section><ApprovedContent kind="programs"/></Base>
